{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_144_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_144","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春，周公出奔晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_144_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_144","textTraditional":"周有入無出。曰出，上下一見之也。言其上下之道，無以存也。上雖失之，下孰敢有之？今上下皆失之矣。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_144_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_144","textTraditional":"二、夏，公會晉侯、衞侯於瑣澤。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_144_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_144","textTraditional":"三、秋，晉人敗狄於交剛。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_144_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_144","textTraditional":"中國與夷狄不言戰。皆曰敗之，夷狄不日。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_144_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_144","textTraditional":"四、冬，十月。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}